    {
      "name": "Supplier outage simulation",
      "description": "These requests require the api and worker containers to be restarted with SIMULATE_SUPPLIER_DOWN=a set. Run: docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.outage.yml up -d --build before running this folder. (This applies the documented outage override.) Restore normal operation afterward by restarting with docker compose -f docker-compose.yml up -d --build without that variable.",
